        },
        {
          "text": "kugira ngw imitima yabo ireme, kuko bamatanirijwe mu rukundo ngo bahabge itunga ryose ry’ugutahura ata mazinda, babone kumenya ibanga ry’Imana, ni ryo Kristo, ",
