        {
          "text": "Kuko naho ntari kumwe namwe ku mubiri, ndi kumwe namwe ku mutima, nnezerewe kandi mbona ugushira hamwe kwanyu kwiza, n’ugushikama mu kwizera Kristo kwanyu.",
          "type": "text",
