          "text": "Ntihakagire umuntu abagunga impēra yanyu, nk’uko yigombera ubgiwe, ayibagungishije kwicisha bugufi no gusenga abamarayika, aguma mu vyo yabonye gusa, atewe kwihimbariza ubusa n’ubgenge bg’akameremere kiwe, ",
